Enjoy huge collection of Keyboard Backgrounds, cool Fonts, Symbols, Kaomojis, Text & Emoji Arts, that works in ALL social networks, messengers, chat and email apps!

Main Fonts App Features & Content:
- 60+ cool stylish fonts that works in all apps: social networks, messengers, chat & email apps;
- Customize your keyboard by choosing from the 1000+ colorful keyboard backgrounds for every taste, color and mood;
- Express your feelings and emotions in a new way by using the 900+ Kaomojis & 250 + Emoji Arts;
- Explore the biggest symbol collection of more than 1000+ symbols, characters and shapes including flowers, arrows, stars, geometric shapes, pointing, etc. to choose from;
- Type all of app content directly into other apps, forget about copy & pasting.
- No data collection when type.

All that you need to enjoy this huge amount of content is just enable Fonts App keyboard on your device and allow Full Access.

How to use Fonts App keyboard:
- Enable the Fonts App keyboard on your device. Full guide how to do it you can find inside the app described in 3 ways;
- Open any social network, messengers, chat or email app;
- Tap and hold Globe key and choose Fonts App keyboard from the list;
- Enjoy using and tying!

What to expect inside Fonts App:
- 60+ Fonts, that works in all social networks, messengers, chat and email apps;
- 1000+ Symbols separated into 30 categories;
- 900+ Kaomojis separated into 40 categories;
- 250+ Emoji Arts separated into 11 categories;
- 1000+ colorful Keyboard Backgrounds with daily updates for every taste, color and mood, separated into 18 categories;
- 5 Free items in each type of content and content category. Total Free content items count is 475;
- No Ads!

Note that free version of the app is limited to:
– 5 Free Fonts;
– 5 Free Symbols in each category - 150 total free.
– 5 Free Kaomojis in each category - 200 total free.
– 5 Free Emoji Arts in each category - 55 total free.
– 5 Free Keyboard Backgrounds in each category - 90 total free.
If you want to use the app without limits an auto-renewable subscription ”Fonts App Pro” is available.

